<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trans-flŭo</span></b> , xi, 3,
			v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to flow</i> or <i>run through</i>
			(post-Aug. and very rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanguis,</span>”
				<i>runs out</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 38, 91, § 224</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina,</span>”
				<i>soaks through</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					16, 35, 63, § 155</span></i>
			.— * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of time, <i>to pass
			away</i>, <i>elapse</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Ep. 4, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
